1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 37=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:42,120
Captain Wei.

7
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,200
Lin Jinqi.

8
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,310
What we did was rebellion.

9
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,070
Are you saying
you can offer us a way out?

10
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,120
Wei.

11
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,200
You can still atone by earning merit.

12
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:31,030
Presenting Duke Ying.

13
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:37,550
(Duke Ying, Grand Preceptor,
Commander of the Five Armies Camp)

14
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,540
(Left Chief Commander
of the Central Military Command)

15
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,992
I deserve death for arriving too late
to protect Your Majesty.

16
00:03:42,008 --> 00:03:44,240
Forgive me for letting
Your Majesty suffer such a fright.

17
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,560
I know you've fought
all night without rest.

18
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:50,750
You've worked hard.

19
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:54,080
With you by my side,
the realm is truly blessed.

20
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,840
I'm unworthy of such praise.

21
00:03:57,096 --> 00:03:58,190
We quelled this rebellion

22
00:03:58,310 --> 00:04:00,240
thanks to Your Majesty's great fortune

23
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:03,430
and every official who did their duty.

24
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,030
As for the rebels in the city,

25
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:07,112
those who resisted
to the end have all been executed.

26
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,910
The rest are in custody,

27
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,280
awaiting Your Majesty's judgment.

28
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,710
Have you counted them?

29
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:15,310
How many rebels escaped?

30
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,270
Yes, we have.

31
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:19,600
Over 2,000 rebels fled the capital.

32
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,310
Your Majesty.

33
00:04:22,472 --> 00:04:24,120
With the rebels scattered everywhere,

34
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,800
they're sure to plunder the people.

35
00:04:25,870 --> 00:04:28,530
If they turn into roving bandits,
they'll plague the whole region.

36
00:04:28,712 --> 00:04:30,560
I ask Your Majesty
to issue an order at once

37
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,120
and send troops to wipe out
Prince Han's remaining forces.

38
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:35,160
Grand Secretary Xie is right.

39
00:04:35,848 --> 00:04:37,720
Hunting down
Prince Han's remaining forces

40
00:04:37,912 --> 00:04:39,400
will be the duke's responsibility.

41
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,120
I'll do everything in my power

42
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:43,600
to restore peace to the people.

43
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,480
In quelling this rebellion,

44
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:48,720
Fengtai not only warned us in advance,

45
00:04:49,070 --> 00:04:50,950
but also sent word to Duke Ying in time.

46
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,360
His merit is immense.

47
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,870
Now no one knows if he's alive or dead.

48
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,480
While you hunt down
Prince Han's remaining forces,

49
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:59,360
be sure to look for Fengtai.

50
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,270
As Your Majesty commands.

51
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:02,720
Your Majesty,

52
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,270
according to my men who led the search,

53
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:07,560
Madam Lin is missing, too.

54
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,390
She's most likely
with Deputy Commander Lin.

55
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,920
In this bitter cold,

56
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:15,750
Madam Lin is a frail woman,

57
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,360
and Fengtai is wounded.

58
00:05:17,672 --> 00:05:19,240
Their lives must be in grave danger.

59
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:21,270
Find them both as soon as possible.

60
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,120
Yes, Your Majesty.

61
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,630
Your Majesty,

62
00:05:26,104 --> 00:05:27,310
I'd like to leave the city

63
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:28,720
and help Duke Ying

64
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:30,560
search for Deputy Commander Lin

65
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,870
and Madam Lin.

66
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,310
Granted.

67
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:43,870
- Deputy Commander Lin!
- Deputy Commander Lin!

68
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:44,870
Young Master!

69
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,270
Deputy Commander Lin!

70
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:47,630
Young Master!

71
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,110
Over there! Go take a look!

72
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,990
- Deputy Commander Lin!
- Deputy Commander Lin!

73
00:05:52,008 --> 00:05:52,720
Young Master!

74
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,950
- Deputy Commander Lin!
- Deputy Commander Lin!

75
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,270
Young Master!

76
00:05:58,510 --> 00:06:00,310
Young Master!

77
00:06:00,870 --> 00:06:01,190
Lan...

78
00:06:01,352 --> 00:06:03,310
- Deputy Commander Lin!
- Deputy Commander Lin!

79
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:13,360
Deputy Commander Lin!

80
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:21,830
Compiler Han.

81
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:40,310
This turmoil...

82
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,750
Countless innocent people
in and around the capital

83
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,240
were caught up in it

84
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,160
and lost their lives.

85
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,750
Deputy Commander Lin...

86
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,950
Give them a proper burial.

87
00:06:59,510 --> 00:07:00,190
Yes, sir.

88
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,000
Compiler Han.

89
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,510
Compiler Han.

90
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,920
The soldiers up ahead report there's

91
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:09,816
- fighting at the Shenji Battalion.
- Deputy Commander Lin!

92
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,830
The Shenji Battalion?

93
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,720
It should be empty by now.

94
00:07:17,288 --> 00:07:20,040
Could Deputy Commander Lin
and the others have gone back?

95
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:31,620
(Dong Qingzhu, daughter of the Assistant
Magistrate of Wanping County)

96
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,950
We surrender.

97
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,830
We said we surrender!

98
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,160
We told you to surrender before,

99
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,160
and you refused.

100
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,680
Whether you can surrender now

101
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,310
isn't up to you.

102
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,510
It's up to us.

103
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:47,120
Don't force us
to fight you to the death!

104
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,310
- Then we'll fight to the death.
- Stay back.

105
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,160
My father has been avenged.

106
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,190
I'm not afraid to die.

107
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,510
Stay back.

108
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:09,000
Then tell us,

109
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,750
what does it take to surrender?

110
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:16,480
Those who haven't
harmed civilians may surrender.

111
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:19,270
Those who haven't
violated women may surrender.

112
00:08:19,352 --> 00:08:20,390
What about those who stole

113
00:08:20,408 --> 00:08:21,720
but didn't kill anyone?
Can they surrender?

114
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:22,240
Yes.

115
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,950
They may.

116
00:08:24,264 --> 00:08:26,540
But the stolen goods must
be returned to the county office,

117
00:08:26,550 --> 00:08:28,024
and they must accept their punishment.

118
00:08:28,344 --> 00:08:30,870
A hundred strokes of the cane
and three years of penal servitude.

119
00:08:30,936 --> 00:08:32,648
- I'm not surrendering!
- I surrender!

120
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,120
What did you say?

121
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:35,870
I surrender!

122
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,270
Say that again!

123
00:08:37,750 --> 00:08:38,510
I surrender!

124
00:08:42,024 --> 00:08:44,120
Clever. She turned them
against each other.

125
00:08:44,152 --> 00:08:46,170
That's the only daughter of the
Assistant Magistrate of Wanping County,

126
00:08:46,184 --> 00:08:46,920
Young Lady Dong.

127
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:48,750
After Prince Han rose in rebellion,

128
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,488
Assistant Magistrate Dong
refused to yield

129
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:52,080
and was murdered by Dai Rui.

130
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:54,480
Amid the chaos, Young Lady Dong

131
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,360
rallied the constables and townsfolk

132
00:08:56,568 --> 00:08:58,104
and killed Dai Rui with her own hands.

133
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,840
After Prince Han's defeat,

134
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,630
his remaining troops fled in a panic.

135
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,150
Young Lady Dong feared they would

136
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:05,480
prey on the people along the way,

137
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,940
so she pursued them all the way here.

138
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:10,720
Let's go.

139
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:16,550
- Get down! All of you, get down!
- Get down!

140
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,270
Young Lady Dong.

141
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,950
Duke Ying has been
ordered by His Majesty

142
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,640
to wipe out Prince Han's
remaining forces.

143
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:26,150
Leave this to the Five Armies Camp.

144
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:27,910
All right.

145
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,080
Behave yourselves!

146
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:55,180
♪Every word♪

147
00:09:55,448 --> 00:09:56,990
- Young Lady Dong!
- Young Lady Dong!

148
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,616
- Young Lady Dong!
- Young Lady Dong!

149
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:02,970
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

150
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,470
- Young Lady Dong!
- Young Lady Dong!

151
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,180
Young Lady Dong!

152
00:10:05,288 --> 00:10:05,960
Young Lady Dong!

153
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,608
- Young Lady Dong!
- Young Lady Dong!

154
00:10:07,710 --> 00:10:14,380
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

155
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:17,840
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

156
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:22,750
♪Quietly dwell here♪

157
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:24,720
Are you an official?

158
00:10:26,344 --> 00:10:27,960
I'm a Compiler at the Hanlin Academy.

159
00:10:28,550 --> 00:10:30,320
My name is Han Liang.

160
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,960
Compiler Han,

161
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,960
please find a physician
for Young Lady Dong.

162
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,750
I'm fine.

163
00:10:36,750 --> 00:10:38,750
I just haven't eaten
in a day and a night,

164
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:41,200
so I'm a little dizzy and weak.

165
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:43,910
Compiler Han,

166
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,870
the people who came with me

167
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:49,360
are at the end of their strength, too.

168
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,270
They badly need food and rest.

169
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,720
May I trouble you, Compiler Han,

170
00:10:56,110 --> 00:10:58,840
to send men to escort them back
to the assistant magistrate's office

171
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:01,720
and arrange meals and lodging for them?

172
00:11:02,296 --> 00:11:04,392
Those who keep watch
through the night for others

173
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:07,960
deserve to see the light of dawn.

174
00:11:08,888 --> 00:11:10,790
At the office,
there are still wounded people

175
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:12,320
in need of treatment,

176
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:15,510
and children
who have lost their parents.

177
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:17,960
Rest assured, Young Lady Dong.

178
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,600
I will make sure

179
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,120
every one of them is well cared for.

180
00:11:23,690 --> 00:11:27,740
♪With my own hands and heart♪

181
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:31,270
♪I write my name♪

182
00:11:31,660 --> 00:11:34,980
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

183
00:11:35,310 --> 00:11:38,560
♪Step by step toward the light♪

184
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:42,610
♪With what I know and what I do♪

185
00:11:42,830 --> 00:11:46,040
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

186
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,440
♪The long night is almost over♪

187
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,240
Compiler Han.

188
00:11:50,488 --> 00:11:52,770
All of Prince Han's remaining forces
have been captured.

189
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:54,720
Would you like to come with us

190
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,504
and keep searching
for Deputy Commander Lin?

191
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,200
Compiler Han?

192
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,240
I just promised Young Lady Dong

193
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,960
I'd help settle the people.

194
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,270
As for finding Deputy Commander Lin

195
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:18,910
and Madam Lin,

196
00:12:20,408 --> 00:12:21,720
I'll have to leave that to you.

197
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,080
Don't worry, Compiler Han.

198
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:25,360
Thank you.

199
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,750
What gives you the nerve

200
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:36,270
to call yourselves an elite force?

201
00:12:36,312 --> 00:12:38,840
You're not even a match
for Compiler Han of the Hanlin Academy!

202
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,390
He's just a frail scholar,

203
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:45,150
and he captured dozens of rebels
from the Tiance Guards!

204
00:12:46,510 --> 00:12:49,270
I sent you to find
Deputy Commander Lin and Madam Lin,

205
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:51,080
and you came back empty-handed.

206
00:12:51,910 --> 00:12:53,870
I sent you
after Prince Han's remaining forces,

207
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:56,550
and you still came back empty-handed!

208
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:59,150
Over two thousand of Prince Han's men

209
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,270
are scattered about,

210
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,512
burning, killing, and looting.

211
00:13:01,672 --> 00:13:03,320
People should be coming to report them.

212
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:04,670
Yet apart from yesterday,

213
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,270
when some people were harmed,

214
00:13:06,750 --> 00:13:07,320
since then,

215
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,320
not a single straggler has been seen.

216
00:13:09,910 --> 00:13:11,000
It's very strange.

217
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,200
It's as if

218
00:13:12,392 --> 00:13:14,240
someone got ahead
of us to steal the credit.

219
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:15,720
Steal the credit?

220
00:13:16,888 --> 00:13:19,030
Who else in the capital
besides our Five Armies Camp

221
00:13:19,030 --> 00:13:19,960
could possibly do that?

222
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:23,870
You're all useless!

223
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:27,390
How am I supposed to face His Majesty?

224
00:13:37,630 --> 00:13:38,480
Your Grace.

225
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,630
What is it?

226
00:13:39,672 --> 00:13:41,064
Sun Yong and Wei Bao
are here with Prince Han's

227
00:13:41,070 --> 00:13:42,490
remaining forces, asking to see you.

228
00:13:42,870 --> 00:13:45,030
What nonsense are you talking?

229
00:13:45,928 --> 00:13:48,030
It's bad enough
you can't find Deputy Commander Lin,

230
00:13:48,630 --> 00:13:50,320
but now you're accusing his men

231
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,870
of colluding with Prince Han's rebels?

232
00:13:51,870 --> 00:13:52,650
No, that's not it.

233
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:55,550
Sun Yong and Wei Bao
have come together to surrender.

234
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:56,840
No...

235
00:13:56,856 --> 00:13:58,630
Come see for yourself
and you'll understand.

236
00:13:58,750 --> 00:13:59,790
I can walk on my own!

237
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,550
Easy, brothers.

238
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:11,510
These men have all turned
from the wrong path

239
00:14:11,544 --> 00:14:13,080
and pledged allegiance to His Majesty!

240
00:14:21,100 --> 00:14:22,700
I, Wei Bao, leading the Changling Guards

241
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:24,220
and what remains of the Tiance Guards,

242
00:14:24,248 --> 00:14:25,440
pay respects to Duke Ying.

243
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:32,110
Deputy Commander Lin and I
became friends after crossing swords.

244
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,150
At his urging...

245
00:14:38,056 --> 00:14:39,460
I chose to stand on the right side.

246
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:40,840
After Prince Han's defeat,

247
00:14:40,936 --> 00:14:42,136
Captain Wei stepped forward

248
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:44,480
to persuade Prince Han's
remaining troops to surrender,

249
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:46,510
sparing the people further harm.

250
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:48,510
That's a great merit indeed.

251
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
I owe it all to Captain Sun's
help along the way.

252
00:14:54,904 --> 00:14:57,200
His Majesty has been worried
about Deputy Commander Lin.

253
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:59,440
Where is he now?

254
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,550
Duke Ying,

255
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,720
Deputy Commander Lin was badly wounded.

256
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,600
Nanke and Jiugao

257
00:15:06,610 --> 00:15:08,890
have already escorted him
and Madam Lin back to the city.

258
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:21,540
(Lasting Grace)

259
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:37,960
The wound on Deputy Commander Lin's
left hand looks alarming,

260
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,480
but it's nothing serious.

261
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:41,750
It'll just ache a little

262
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,200
on rainy days.

263
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:47,360
His internal injuries
are the real concern.

264
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:49,200
They've affected his vital organs.

265
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,750
He must rest and recover properly.

266
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,270
Otherwise,

267
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:55,960
it may shorten his life.

268
00:16:00,408 --> 00:16:01,750
Thank you, Imperial Physician Yao.

269
00:16:01,848 --> 00:16:03,550
We'll follow
your instructions carefully.

270
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:06,150
He'll take his medicine
on time and rest well.

271
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:09,630
His Majesty is deeply concerned
about Deputy Commander Lin's injuries

272
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,630
and is waiting
for my report in the palace.

273
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,270
So I

274
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:16,750
will take my leave.

275
00:16:16,792 --> 00:16:18,216
Take care, Imperial Physician Yao.

276
00:16:29,030 --> 00:16:30,030
Jinqi, Lanxiang,

277
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,390
what took you so long?

278
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:34,440
We were worried sick.

279
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,840
Well, we're back
safe and sound, aren't we?

280
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,150
Thank you for all your
hard work, Jinlan.

281
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:57,440
Not a single life
was lost in the entire household.

282
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,910
That's all thanks to you.

283
00:17:02,110 --> 00:17:03,500
Lanxiang is the one we should thank.

284
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:07,240
Luckily, she had the foresight

285
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,070
and sent Yuchan back to warn us.

286
00:17:09,944 --> 00:17:11,510
That's how we could prepare in advance

287
00:17:11,528 --> 00:17:12,712
and stay out of harm's way.

288
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,400
I just happened to stumble upon it.

289
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,480
How are you feeling, Jinlan?

290
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:22,160
I'm fine.

291
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:23,790
Just a bit tired.

292
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:25,240
A few days' rest and I'll be well.

293
00:17:25,848 --> 00:17:27,110
Don't worry about me, Lanxiang.

294
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,750
Jinqi needs his rest.

295
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,440
We'll be going now.

296
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:34,030
All right.

297
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:36,960
I'll go, too.

298
00:17:37,750 --> 00:17:39,400
I'll come see you both tomorrow.

299
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:46,920
Let's go.

300
00:17:52,310 --> 00:17:53,000
Xiulai,

301
00:17:53,550 --> 00:17:54,640
keep your brother company.

302
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:55,880
I'll be right back.

303
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:06,160
Are you worried about Jun?

304
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:12,590
Jinqi,

305
00:18:12,936 --> 00:18:14,216
Jun is only nine.

306
00:18:14,312 --> 00:18:16,710
The whole Lu family has been
thrown into the imperial prison.

307
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,550
I know rebellion is a crime punishable
by wiping out the entire clan.

308
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,480
That wretch brought it on himself.

309
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,750
But Jun is my son.

310
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:28,200
I just can't bear

311
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,920
to stand by and watch him be beheaded.

312
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,720
You're the only one I can turn to.

313
00:18:35,144 --> 00:18:36,400
Please, Jinqi, I'm begging you.

314
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:47,920
I called you here

315
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,030
only to find out

316
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:50,790
how Xiaolian
came to fall ill with a fever.

317
00:18:51,350 --> 00:18:52,240
Get up and answer me.

318
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:55,550
Yes.

319
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,350
The situation was urgent at the time.

320
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:02,750
I had a servant
who knew the mountain paths

321
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:04,750
took me to a village
near the Shenji Battalion,

322
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,550
and ordered the driver
to take Xiaolian back to the retreat.

323
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,070
But Gantang said

324
00:19:09,544 --> 00:19:11,640
that when Xiaolian
was brought back to the retreat,

325
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:13,450
she already had
a fever and was unconscious,

326
00:19:13,496 --> 00:19:15,400
and that you were
the one who had her sent back.

327
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:16,720
Xiaolian...

328
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:19,550
That driver
is still nowhere to be found.

329
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,750
That's why I had Yang Fu bring you here,

330
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:25,400
to find out exactly what happened.

331
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,790
Young Madam,

332
00:19:27,256 --> 00:19:28,510
on the Young Master's orders,

333
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:30,680
I was heading to the Five Armies Camp
to see Duke Ying

334
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,310
when I heard a woman crying for help.

335
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,960
Bodhisattva, protect me.

336
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:37,000
I don't want to die.

337
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,160
Bodhisattva, protect me.

338
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:47,790
Please send a kind soul to save me.

339
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,000
Help...

340
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,960
Help...

341
00:20:17,590 --> 00:20:20,160
Help!

342
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,350
Nanke...

343
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:48,070
When the driver
heard there'd be fighting,

344
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:51,030
he panicked and ran off,
leaving me behind.

345
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:57,030
He took all my money and jewelry.

346
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,440
Young Lady Xiaolian was already so cold

347
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,680
that she was shivering all over.

348
00:21:30,888 --> 00:21:32,890
But I thought
the Young Master's orders came first,

349
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:36,070
so I took her with me and rode hard
all the way to the Five Armies Camp.

350
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:37,510
That made her illness worse.

351
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:40,880
Once I saw Duke Ying
set out with his troops,

352
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:43,440
I borrowed a carriage
from the Five Armies Camp

353
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:46,350
and asked them to take
Young Lady Xiaolian to the retreat.

354
00:21:51,256 --> 00:21:53,240
Young Lady Xiaolian's illness
is partly my fault.

355
00:21:53,592 --> 00:21:55,016
I'm willing to accept punishment.

356
00:21:55,790 --> 00:21:57,400
That driver is despicable.

357
00:21:58,270 --> 00:21:59,656
He mustn't be let off lightly.

358
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:03,200
Please punish me, Young Madam.

359
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:05,200
It was my poor judgment

360
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:06,550
that led me to hire such

361
00:22:06,790 --> 00:22:08,480
a disloyal scoundrel.

362
00:22:08,616 --> 00:22:11,096
Are there any other servants
like him in the household?

363
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:13,310
Yes.

364
00:22:14,550 --> 00:22:16,550
Two servants took advantage
of the chaos to steal

365
00:22:16,550 --> 00:22:18,780
the Second Young Lady's
jewelry and money, then ran off.

366
00:22:19,310 --> 00:22:21,720
It's all because
I've been too lax in managing them

367
00:22:21,736 --> 00:22:23,224
and failed to train them properly.

368
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,640
Second Butler Yang,

369
00:22:24,888 --> 00:22:26,490
go report this to the authorities first.

370
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,750
The rest

371
00:22:27,896 --> 00:22:29,550
can wait until everyone has recovered.

372
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:30,680
Yes.

373
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:39,960
Young Lady Xiaolian...

374
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,400
Is she very ill?

375
00:22:44,344 --> 00:22:45,048
The physician said

376
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:47,310
the worst thing for this illness
is fright and worry.

377
00:22:47,350 --> 00:22:48,990
Luckily, the girl
takes things in stride.

378
00:22:49,048 --> 00:22:50,030
A few more days of sleep,

379
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:51,550
and she'll recover.

380
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:08,880
You seem troubled, Young Madam.

381
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,750
Is something bothering you?

382
00:23:15,656 --> 00:23:17,736
This time, thank goodness
the Second Young Master

383
00:23:18,070 --> 00:23:19,240
was so careful.

384
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:20,790
Otherwise,

385
00:23:21,110 --> 00:23:22,550
I'm afraid those servants

386
00:23:22,550 --> 00:23:24,490
would have sold out
their masters to the rebels.

387
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,000
And then,

388
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,480
Yuchan,

389
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,310
Xiulai, Xiuwan,

390
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,160
and Yingzhi

391
00:23:31,112 --> 00:23:32,400
would all have been in danger.

392
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:36,790
It's true.

393
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,400
To bring order to one's household,

394
00:23:40,110 --> 00:23:41,510
one must first cultivate oneself.

395
00:23:42,248 --> 00:23:43,740
When masters don't act like masters,

396
00:23:43,750 --> 00:23:45,096
servants won't act like servants,

397
00:23:45,352 --> 00:23:47,000
and the household will never know peace.

398
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,200
Yuchan.

399
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:52,680
Yuchan!

400
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,350
Yuchan!

401
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:58,720
Listen to me.

402
00:23:59,224 --> 00:24:00,310
I don't want to hear it.

403
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,200
If you keep this up,

404
00:24:07,270 --> 00:24:08,240
I'll call for someone.

405
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:09,880
Go ahead.

406
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:12,392
Might as well bring out
the Young Master and Young Madam too.

407
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,550
We can settle this

408
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:14,590
right in front of them.

409
00:24:18,008 --> 00:24:19,440
What exactly are you trying to say?

410
00:24:19,510 --> 00:24:19,880
I...

411
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,160
I asked you something earlier,

412
00:24:22,184 --> 00:24:23,450
and you still haven't answered.

413
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,270
Do you...

414
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:27,640
Do you know how I feel about you or not?

415
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:31,030
Out of nowhere...

416
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:32,720
What's gotten into you?

417
00:24:35,544 --> 00:24:37,352
Do you know

418
00:24:37,420 --> 00:24:38,590
how many dead bodies I've seen

419
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:40,160
since the day before yesterday until today?

420
00:24:40,968 --> 00:24:42,590
I kept thinking
about you the whole time.

421
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:45,000
Didn't you think about me

422
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,550
even a little?

423
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,240
Swords don't pick their targets.

424
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:55,160
What if I had died...

425
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:55,790
Stop it!

426
00:24:56,310 --> 00:24:57,160
There's no "what if".

427
00:24:59,880 --> 00:25:00,790
Quick, take that back!

428
00:25:01,790 --> 00:25:02,750
A troublemaker like you

429
00:25:03,310 --> 00:25:04,590
is bound to live to a hundred.

430
00:25:06,750 --> 00:25:08,200
So you do care about me.

431
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,960
I'm older than you,

432
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:15,240
and I've been married before.

433
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:18,000
Madam Wu would never agree.

434
00:25:21,688 --> 00:25:23,160
I never dared to let myself care.

435
00:25:27,448 --> 00:25:29,704
You'd better give up on this too.
The sooner, the better.

436
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:34,750
As for my mother,

437
00:25:36,030 --> 00:25:37,030
I'll find a way.

438
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:40,400
What way could you possibly find?

439
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,590
Your father died young.

440
00:25:42,872 --> 00:25:45,070
Madam Wu raised you on her own.
It wasn't easy for her.

441
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,350
You mustn't break her heart.

442
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:49,720
Besides...

443
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:50,960
Besides,

444
00:25:51,736 --> 00:25:53,680
you were sold into
the household at six or seven,

445
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,960
and you don't remember
who your parents are

446
00:25:55,976 --> 00:25:56,936
or where you came from.

447
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:59,270
My mother took pity on you

448
00:25:59,304 --> 00:26:00,550
and has always looked after you.

449
00:26:01,960 --> 00:26:03,590
So you can't do anything to hurt her.

450
00:26:05,640 --> 00:26:06,070
You...

451
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:13,400
You...

452
00:26:15,448 --> 00:26:16,968
When you were hiding in the theater...

453
00:26:23,110 --> 00:26:24,310
You were worried about me too.

454
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,270
You were scared

455
00:26:29,030 --> 00:26:30,030
you'd never see me again.

456
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:33,830
Weren't you?

457
00:26:53,270 --> 00:26:55,230
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

458
00:26:56,270 --> 00:26:57,200
Trust me.

459
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:58,440
I'll get my mother

460
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,440
to gladly agree to our marriage!

461
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:04,160
Jiugao is usually so sharp.

462
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:05,750
Nothing ever gets past him.

463
00:27:06,790 --> 00:27:08,480
Yet here we are,

464
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:09,640
standing right here,

465
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,640
and he didn't notice a thing.

466
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,790
Whenever Jiugao was around Yuchan,

467
00:27:14,270 --> 00:27:15,550
I'd get anxious for him.

468
00:27:15,830 --> 00:27:16,720
But today,

469
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:18,750
it's like he's finally figured it out.

470
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:22,160
The old saying is true.

471
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:25,480
Every setback makes you a little wiser.

472
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:27,310
♪I can't forget♪

473
00:27:27,920 --> 00:27:29,070
Mending what's broken

474
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,030
is never too late.

475
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:36,080
♪Love lingers all around us♪

476
00:27:37,120 --> 00:27:41,992
♪Holding hands through
this life, breathing♪

477
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:47,420
♪In the fragrance
that fills the courtyard♪

478
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:58,750
You're back.

479
00:28:04,310 --> 00:28:05,790
I thought you'd gone to sleep.

480
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,680
I was waiting for you.

481
00:28:09,310 --> 00:28:10,310
Where did you go?

482
00:28:12,070 --> 00:28:13,750
I had some things to think over,

483
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:16,720
so I sat outside and let the breeze
clear my head for a while.

484
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:18,160
Before I knew it,

485
00:28:18,590 --> 00:28:19,550
night had fallen.

486
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,110
Two heads are better

487
00:28:34,830 --> 00:28:36,000
than one.

488
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:39,000
Would you share it with your husband?

489
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:50,480
In plays,

490
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,310
officials who hold a post

491
00:28:52,310 --> 00:28:53,750
but neglect its duties

492
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,440
are the ones people hate most.

493
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:58,030
And without realizing it,

494
00:28:58,750 --> 00:29:01,070
I've become one of those
petty villains on the stage.

495
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:04,200
What makes you say that?

496
00:29:05,544 --> 00:29:07,270
I'm the Young Madam
of the Lin Residence.

497
00:29:08,000 --> 00:29:09,640
What the servants and maids

498
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:11,030
should do

499
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:12,350
and shouldn't do,

500
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:14,070
who to employ and who not to,

501
00:29:14,790 --> 00:29:16,480
all of it should be under my charge.

502
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:20,350
But I held the position
without doing the job.

503
00:29:21,784 --> 00:29:22,830
As a result, the servants

504
00:29:23,550 --> 00:29:24,830
became a mixed lot,

505
00:29:25,350 --> 00:29:26,720
with no loyalty among them.

506
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:31,480
Luckily, the Second Young Master
was here,

507
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:33,960
so we only lost some valuables.

508
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:36,720
But the driver at the retreat

509
00:29:37,030 --> 00:29:38,550
not only stole money,

510
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:41,030
but he also abandoned Xiaolian
in the wilderness.

511
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:43,750
If not for Nanke,

512
00:29:45,310 --> 00:29:47,720
Xiaolian would have frozen
to death outside the capital.

513
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:55,720
I thought if I stayed out of it

514
00:29:55,992 --> 00:29:57,750
and kept to myself,
that would be enough.

515
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:01,880
But I forgot

516
00:30:02,830 --> 00:30:04,160
that when you're part of it all,

517
00:30:05,070 --> 00:30:06,200
you can't stay untouched.

518
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:10,070
I nearly cost someone her life.

519
00:30:11,208 --> 00:30:12,920
That would have been a grave mistake.

520
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,830
It's not your fault.

521
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:19,480
It's mine.

522
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:22,510
I ignored your wishes

523
00:30:23,070 --> 00:30:24,070
and married you.

524
00:30:25,590 --> 00:30:27,350
That's why you resented me,

525
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,960
paid no attention
to the household affairs,

526
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:34,550
and always treated yourself
as an outsider.

527
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:43,350
Lanxiang,

528
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:45,790
before,

529
00:30:47,110 --> 00:30:49,400
I always thought
it was because of Han Liang

530
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,160
that you resented me

531
00:30:52,792 --> 00:30:55,720
and refused to settle into being
the Young Madam of the Lin family.

532
00:30:57,830 --> 00:30:59,830
But only now do I understand

533
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:03,270
it was never about love for another man.

534
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:05,640
Rather,

535
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,270
it's just like when Grand Secretary Zhao

536
00:31:12,070 --> 00:31:14,200
wanted to control my career and my life,

537
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:17,960
to make me serve him
and the Zhao family.

538
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:21,720
I chose to give up
the brush for the sword

539
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:24,000
and joined the army in Jinzhou

540
00:31:25,880 --> 00:31:27,510
rather than let him control me.

541
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:32,200
I suppose it's the same for you.

542
00:31:34,270 --> 00:31:35,350
What you resent

543
00:31:36,550 --> 00:31:38,510
is that I took away your freedom.

544
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:41,440
I thought

545
00:31:42,110 --> 00:31:44,310
if I said sweet things to please you,

546
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:46,960
if I were gentler,

547
00:31:47,510 --> 00:31:48,830
more considerate,

548
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,000
and treated you better,

549
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:54,350
I could win your heart.

550
00:31:55,790 --> 00:31:58,200
But only after I read
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal

551
00:31:59,590 --> 00:32:00,590
did I realize

552
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:04,160
that in your eyes,

553
00:32:05,030 --> 00:32:06,310
love between a man and a woman

554
00:32:07,510 --> 00:32:09,640
is nothing
but flowers on a desolate grave,

555
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:12,550
a fair face over bare bones,

556
00:32:13,960 --> 00:32:15,480
like a dream, like a bubble,

557
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:18,440
gone in an instant.

558
00:32:20,350 --> 00:32:21,920
I was too arrogant.

559
00:32:23,680 --> 00:32:24,640
I underestimated you.

560
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:34,240
Actually,

561
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,790
I underestimated you, too.

562
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:42,270
True, you don't know what I think,

563
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:44,000
or what I like and dislike.

564
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:48,310
But I don't know what you think,

565
00:32:49,368 --> 00:32:51,000
or what you like and dislike, either.

566
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:06,680
We're both still young.

567
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,720
We have plenty of time

568
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:16,400
to truly get to know each other.

569
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:32,000
Between you and me,

570
00:33:33,110 --> 00:33:34,830
there are too many barriers.

571
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:37,680
You and I

572
00:33:39,384 --> 00:33:40,350
walk different paths.

573
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:44,160
Do you mean
family background and status?

574
00:33:47,750 --> 00:33:48,960
I promise you,

575
00:33:50,030 --> 00:33:51,160
from now on,

576
00:33:52,070 --> 00:33:53,030
I will respect you

577
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:54,400
and value you

578
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:57,240
as if you were another me in this world.

579
00:33:58,350 --> 00:33:59,960
Even if right now

580
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:03,160
you don't love me
as a wife loves her husband,

581
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:09,590
we've been through hardship together.

582
00:34:11,096 --> 00:34:12,960
We already share
a bond as husband and wife.

583
00:34:16,030 --> 00:34:17,360
No matter what,

584
00:34:18,440 --> 00:34:19,230
we both

585
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,800
have to live well.

586
00:34:32,510 --> 00:34:34,230
There's a lot to do tomorrow.

587
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:37,670
You should get some rest, too.

588
00:34:43,700 --> 00:34:48,190
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

589
00:34:48,820 --> 00:34:52,990
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

590
00:34:53,420 --> 00:34:56,720
♪I've searched and searched,
wandering in circles♪

591
00:34:56,720 --> 00:34:59,510
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

592
00:34:59,830 --> 00:35:02,660
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

593
00:35:02,860 --> 00:35:07,290
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

594
00:35:07,700 --> 00:35:12,800
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

595
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:21,530
♪I only pray that fate
lets us meet sooner♪

596
00:35:23,980 --> 00:35:28,020
(Mahavira Hall)

597
00:35:28,020 --> 00:35:32,100
(Devotee Mu, Devotee Chen)

598
00:35:35,980 --> 00:35:39,580
(Devotee Qingxiang)

599
00:35:39,580 --> 00:35:43,140
(Devotee Xingtang)

600
00:36:18,150 --> 00:36:19,030
This tree

601
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:21,480
looks the same year after year,

602
00:36:22,510 --> 00:36:24,590
but people change
with every passing year.

603
00:36:26,030 --> 00:36:27,110
Who would have thought

604
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:29,480
someone like Zhao Xingtang

605
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:31,320
could be gone just like that?

606
00:36:43,190 --> 00:36:44,400
Life is unpredictable,

607
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,070
and people's hearts are fickle.

608
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:49,800
When I insisted
on separating from the Lu family,

609
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:53,440
everyone condemned me
for defying propriety.

610
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,400
Now they all praise me

611
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:56,630
for my foresight.

612
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:59,550
I not only saved myself,

613
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:02,510
but my daughter's life as well.

614
00:37:04,670 --> 00:37:05,670
What about Jun?

615
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:08,150
Has Jinqi given you a definite answer?

616
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,920
Jinqi said

617
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:13,070
since Jun is still so young,

618
00:37:13,112 --> 00:37:14,550
His Majesty is willing to spare him.

619
00:37:18,110 --> 00:37:18,960
It's just that...

620
00:37:21,896 --> 00:37:24,490
For three generations, they can't
take the imperial examinations

621
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:26,630
or hold office.

622
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,710
For a man,

623
00:37:29,944 --> 00:37:31,510
the examinations and officialdom aren't

624
00:37:31,510 --> 00:37:32,550
the only path in life.

625
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:34,710
Lanxiang said the same thing before.

626
00:37:40,440 --> 00:37:42,590
First Young Lady, Second Young Lady.

627
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,320
The Young Madam is still at prayer?

628
00:37:45,016 --> 00:37:46,760
Second Butler Yang
has something to report?

629
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,216
The Young Madam instructed earlier

630
00:37:48,220 --> 00:37:50,320
that Sixth Young Lady Zhao's
body at the public burial ground

631
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:52,460
be placed in a coffin
and sent to the Xie family.

632
00:37:52,510 --> 00:37:53,990
But while we were preparing her body,

633
00:37:54,030 --> 00:37:55,400
we learned that the Sixth Young Lady

634
00:37:55,410 --> 00:37:57,870
had separated from her husband
and returned to her parents' home.

635
00:37:57,880 --> 00:38:00,190
Now the entire Zhao family is in prison.

636
00:38:00,440 --> 00:38:02,320
What should be done with the body?

637
00:38:02,670 --> 00:38:04,510
We need the Young Madam to decide.

638
00:38:04,792 --> 00:38:06,670
This is Zhao Xingluo's
separation agreement?

639
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:08,280
Yes.

640
00:38:09,070 --> 00:38:09,880
Let me see.

641
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:10,360
Here.

642
00:38:12,968 --> 00:38:13,980
(Separation Agreement)

643
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:15,848
(Our bond was formed
across three lifetimes,)

644
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:17,710
(we were wed through the six rites,)

645
00:38:18,456 --> 00:38:20,280
(and became
husband and wife in this life.)

646
00:38:20,728 --> 00:38:22,440
(But since our hearts have grown apart,)

647
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:23,670
(we can no longer be as one.)

648
00:38:24,550 --> 00:38:26,880
(May my wife, after we part,)

649
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:29,840
(let go of all resentment
and smile again,)

650
00:38:30,230 --> 00:38:31,840
(find a husband of high rank,)

651
00:38:32,280 --> 00:38:33,550
(enjoy feasts and merry games,)

652
00:38:33,560 --> 00:38:35,432
(and live in harmony,
like strings in perfect tune.)

653
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:38,000
Grand Secretary Zhao
had a good eye for grandsons-in-law.

654
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:41,000
Zhao Xingluo's husband

655
00:38:41,760 --> 00:38:42,630
had fine handwriting,

656
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:43,630
fine writing,

657
00:38:44,030 --> 00:38:45,440
and an especially fine heart.

658
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:48,230
Sadly,

659
00:38:48,510 --> 00:38:50,440
just like Zhao Xingtang,

660
00:38:51,030 --> 00:38:52,400
Zhao Xingluo had poor judgment.

661
00:38:53,540 --> 00:38:55,780
(Drawn up by Xie Zhao)

662
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:01,840
The Xie family has already
arranged a match for Xie Zhao.

663
00:39:02,280 --> 00:39:04,550
It's the sixth daughter
of the Zhao family's third branch.

664
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:08,150
What is it?

665
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:10,550
Nothing.

666
00:39:20,550 --> 00:39:21,400
Young Madam.

667
00:39:22,150 --> 00:39:22,920
Young Madam.

668
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,840
This separation agreement was found

669
00:39:24,840 --> 00:39:26,110
on the Sixth Young Lady's body.

670
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:29,800
How should we handle her remains?

671
00:39:34,110 --> 00:39:35,480
She deserves to be laid to rest.

672
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:37,590
I'll pay

673
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:39,190
for Zhao Xingluo's burial,

674
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:40,960
and ask the monks at the temple

675
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:42,280
to perform a ritual for her.

676
00:39:42,710 --> 00:39:43,440
Yes.

677
00:39:48,792 --> 00:39:50,320
You're so kind-hearted, Young Madam.

678
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,590
Zhao Xingluo used to

679
00:39:52,590 --> 00:39:53,840
mock you

680
00:39:54,110 --> 00:39:55,510
and made snide remarks all the time.

681
00:39:56,408 --> 00:39:57,630
In the face of life and death,

682
00:39:58,000 --> 00:39:59,550
those are trivial matters.

683
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:07,960
Will you come home with me,

684
00:40:08,190 --> 00:40:09,280
or look around a bit more?

685
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:14,480
We'll go with you, Lanxiang.

686
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:16,630
Good.

687
00:40:16,680 --> 00:40:18,320
I have something to discuss with you.

688
00:40:22,190 --> 00:40:23,280
So formal?

689
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,630
What is it you'd like
to discuss, Lanxiang?

690
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:29,440
Since we came to the capital,

691
00:40:29,544 --> 00:40:31,510
the household
has taken on many more servants.

692
00:40:31,928 --> 00:40:33,360
Before, when Aunt Lingxiao was here,

693
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:34,710
she took care of everything.

694
00:40:35,670 --> 00:40:37,110
But since she went back to Jinling,

695
00:40:37,360 --> 00:40:39,630
there's been no one in charge.

696
00:40:40,550 --> 00:40:41,760
Yang Fu is capable,

697
00:40:41,944 --> 00:40:43,710
but he's not
one of the masters after all.

698
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:45,550
He told me

699
00:40:45,688 --> 00:40:46,840
that these past few days,

700
00:40:47,150 --> 00:40:49,070
whenever he couldn't decide something,

701
00:40:49,320 --> 00:40:50,800
he'd come to you, Xiulai.

702
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,590
I could see your mind

703
00:40:54,590 --> 00:40:56,230
wasn't on household chores.

704
00:40:57,070 --> 00:40:57,960
And I figured

705
00:40:58,190 --> 00:41:00,030
I'm just another mouth
to feed here anyway,

706
00:41:00,550 --> 00:41:01,960
and I had time on my hands.

707
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:04,000
So when Yang Fu came to me,

708
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,110
I made a few decisions.

709
00:41:06,590 --> 00:41:07,920
If I did anything wrong,

710
00:41:07,920 --> 00:41:09,416
please don't hesitate to punish me.

711
00:41:10,670 --> 00:41:11,510
Sit down, Xiulai.

712
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:18,030
You handled everything

713
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:19,550
remarkably well.

714
00:41:20,190 --> 00:41:21,150
To name just one thing,

715
00:41:21,368 --> 00:41:22,480
before the Chinese New Year,

716
00:41:22,490 --> 00:41:24,390
the gifts you prepared
for the other households

717
00:41:24,408 --> 00:41:25,630
were perfectly appropriate.

718
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:28,110
You thought through every social nicety.

719
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:30,480
Xiulai is skilled

720
00:41:30,590 --> 00:41:33,030
at needlework, cooking, calligraphy,

721
00:41:33,110 --> 00:41:34,110
and bookkeeping.

722
00:41:35,190 --> 00:41:37,800
Too bad the Lu family
was too blind to see her worth.

723
00:41:45,880 --> 00:41:48,150
I'm not as capable
as Xiuwan makes me sound.

724
00:41:53,710 --> 00:41:54,670
This rebellion

725
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:56,710
taught me a lesson, too.

726
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:58,630
Let me tell you both something

727
00:41:58,630 --> 00:41:59,880
from the bottom of my heart.

728
00:42:00,960 --> 00:42:02,400
Your brother

729
00:42:02,410 --> 00:42:04,210
pushed me into this role
before I was ready.

730
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:06,280
My heart truly isn't in

731
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:09,360
managing the food, clothing,
and lodging of an entire household,

732
00:42:09,590 --> 00:42:11,150
down to every last daily need.

733
00:42:11,880 --> 00:42:13,110
Nor do I care to figure out,

734
00:42:13,110 --> 00:42:15,510
when Master Cheng's third concubine
suffers a miscarriage,

735
00:42:15,670 --> 00:42:17,400
how to send condolence gifts

736
00:42:17,710 --> 00:42:19,280
that express sympathy

737
00:42:19,550 --> 00:42:21,030
without offending the in-laws.

738
00:42:22,184 --> 00:42:23,960
Marriage really
has nothing good about it.

739
00:42:24,550 --> 00:42:25,760
Lanxiang is right.

740
00:42:25,840 --> 00:42:27,304
There you go, talking nonsense again.

741
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:28,920
Men handle affairs outside,

742
00:42:29,192 --> 00:42:30,230
and women manage the home.

743
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:33,030
If women don't
take care of their families,

744
00:42:33,150 --> 00:42:34,710
should they go be officials instead?

745
00:42:35,944 --> 00:42:37,320
Everyone has their own aspirations.

746
00:42:37,600 --> 00:42:40,380
Ever since we were little, you've
always been the proper eldest sister,

747
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:42,152
always fussing over
and caring for others.

748
00:42:42,710 --> 00:42:43,670
I'm not like that.

749
00:42:46,400 --> 00:42:47,760
The Lin Residence is so large,

750
00:42:48,320 --> 00:42:49,280
and with the retreat,

751
00:42:49,512 --> 00:42:51,128
there are over a hundred people.

752
00:42:51,416 --> 00:42:53,630
We can't go without
someone running the household.

753
00:42:59,150 --> 00:43:00,480
What you mean is...

754
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

755
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:10,070
Good.

756
00:43:10,590 --> 00:43:12,550
This is truly wonderful news.

757
00:43:15,320 --> 00:43:16,000
Wonderful.

758
00:43:24,952 --> 00:43:25,320
Old...

759
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:26,110
Old Madam!

760
00:43:28,230 --> 00:43:28,880
Old Madam!

761
00:43:31,590 --> 00:43:32,840
- Mother!
- What do we do?

762
00:43:32,850 --> 00:43:33,440
What do we do?

763
00:43:33,440 --> 00:43:34,480
- Mother!
- Mother!

764
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:35,070
What's wrong?

765
00:43:35,150 --> 00:43:36,400
Mother! Mother, what's wrong?

766
00:43:36,400 --> 00:43:37,840
Stop! Don't move her!

767
00:43:37,840 --> 00:43:39,360
Stand aside. Don't get in the way!

768
00:43:39,550 --> 00:43:40,360
Mother!

769
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:42,960
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

770
00:43:43,280 --> 00:43:45,920
Mother! Mother, are you all right?

771
00:43:46,550 --> 00:43:48,070
Madam Wu, get the medicine box.

772
00:43:48,104 --> 00:43:49,590
Huaixiang, fetch a basin of hot water.

773
00:43:49,590 --> 00:43:50,710
Quick! Hurry!

774
00:43:52,350 --> 00:43:52,930
Mother!

775
00:44:08,340 --> 00:44:12,460
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

776
00:44:15,300 --> 00:44:19,820
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

777
00:44:21,100 --> 00:44:25,020
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

778
00:44:25,700 --> 00:44:28,460
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

779
00:44:29,180 --> 00:44:31,500
♪Though all the world may fade♪

780
00:44:31,500 --> 00:44:34,580
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

781
00:44:36,100 --> 00:44:40,340
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

782
00:44:43,260 --> 00:44:47,420
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

783
00:44:49,220 --> 00:44:52,780
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

784
00:44:52,780 --> 00:44:56,340
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

785
00:44:57,140 --> 00:45:02,820
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

786
00:45:03,180 --> 00:45:07,500
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

787
00:45:07,860 --> 00:45:10,820
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

788
00:45:10,820 --> 00:45:14,580
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

789
00:45:14,580 --> 00:45:17,460
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

790
00:45:17,460 --> 00:45:21,540
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

791
00:45:21,540 --> 00:45:24,900
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

792
00:45:24,900 --> 00:45:28,660
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

793
00:45:28,660 --> 00:45:32,660
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

794
00:45:33,420 --> 00:45:37,580
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

795
00:45:37,580 --> 00:45:41,020
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

796
00:45:41,020 --> 00:45:44,660
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

797
00:45:44,660 --> 00:45:47,540
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

798
00:45:47,540 --> 00:45:51,620
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

799
00:45:51,620 --> 00:45:54,980
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

800
00:45:54,980 --> 00:45:58,620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

801
00:45:58,620 --> 00:46:06,420
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

